/*
  Mars Colony theme - a domed settlement on the red planet at dusk, a Starship-
  style rocket on its pad and a rover kicking up dust (res/images/mars.jpg).
  Rust-brown panels framed in dusty orange, sand gold totals, and cyan for
  money coming in.

  The layout is res/flapxcoin.qss, below its variables; the base colours come
  from the theme table in guiutil.cpp.
*/

